[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Global Cost of Living Crisis Index 2026</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1a2744;
    --accent: #c0392b;
    --accent2: #2980b9;
    --accent3: #27ae60;
    --accent4: #e67e22;
    --light-bg: #f4f6fb;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --border: #dde3f0;
    --text: #1a1a2e;
    --muted: #5a6a8a;
    --tier1: #1a6b3c;
    --tier2: #2980b9;
    --tier3: #e67e22;
    --tier4: #c0392b;
    --tier5: #7d1d1d;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    background: var(--light-bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  /* HEADER */
  .report-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2744 0%, #0d1b3e 60%, #1a2744 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 48px 60px 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .report-header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.03'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .header-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8fa8d0;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .report-header h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .report-header .subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #a8bcd8;
    max-width: 660px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #6a88b5;
  }
  .header-meta span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }

  /* LAYOUT */
  .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
  .section { padding: 40px 0 24px; }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent2);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .section-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* KPI CARDS */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(26,39,68,0.06);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .kpi-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 4px; height: 100%;
    background: var(--accent2);
  }
  .kpi-card:nth-child(2)::before { background: var(--accent); }
  .kpi-card:nth-child(3)::before { background: var(--accent3); }
  .kpi-card:nth-child(4)::before { background: var(--tier5); }
  .kpi-card:nth-child(5)::before { background: var(--accent4); }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* CHARTS */
  .chart-grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .chart-grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .chart-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(26,39,68,0.06);
  }
  .chart-card.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  .chart-card.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .chart-subtitle {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .chart-container { position: relative; }

  /* TABLES */
  .data-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .data-table th {
    background: #eef2fa;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .data-table td {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f4fc;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .data-table tr:hover td { background: #f8faff; }
  .data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

  /* TIER BADGES */
  .tier-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tier-1 { background: #d5f0e3; color: #1a6b3c; }
  .tier-2 { background: #d6eaf8; color: #1a5276; }
  .tier-3 { background: #fdebd0; color: #784212; }
  .tier-4 { background: #fce4e4; color: #7b241c; }
  .tier-5 { background: #7d1d1d; color: #ffffff; }

  /* INSIGHT BOXES */
  .insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .insight-box {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent2);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(26,39,68,0.05);
  }
  .insight-box.warning { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
  .insight-box.success { border-left-color: var(--accent3); }
  .insight-box.alert { border-left-color: var(--tier5); }
  .insight-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent2);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .insight-box.warning .insight-label { color: var(--accent); }
  .insight-box.success .insight-label { color: var(--accent3); }
  .insight-box.alert .insight-label { color: var(--tier5); }
  .insight-box h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .insight-box p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }

  /* TIER PROFILE CARDS */
  .tier-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .tier-profile {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(26,39,68,0.05);
  }
  .tier-profile .tier-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .tier-number {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: white;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .t1 { background: var(--tier1); }
  .t2 { background: var(--tier2); }
  .t3 { background: var(--accent4); }
  .t4 { background: var(--accent); }
  .t5 { background: var(--tier5); }
  .tier-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.2; }
  .tier-stat { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 11px; }
  .tier-stat .stat-label { color: var(--muted); }
  .tier-stat .stat-value { font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }
  .tier-cities { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }

  /* BAR CHART CUSTOM */
  .hbar-container { width: 100%; }
  .hbar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 7px; gap: 8px; }
  .hbar-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text); width: 120px; flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .hbar-track { flex: 1; background: #eef2fa; border-radius: 3px; height: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hbar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.3s; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .hbar-val { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: white; padding: 0 6px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hbar-val-outside { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); padding-left: 4px; }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #8fa8d0;
    padding: 28px 60px;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  footer a { color: #8fa8d0; text-decoration: none; }

  /* CALLOUT */
  .callout {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border: 1px solid #f9d56e;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #7d5a00;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-intro {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 800px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .outlier-badge {
    background: #fff3cd;
    border: 1px solid #ffc107;
    color: #856404;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  .findings-list { list-style: none; }
  .findings-list li {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent2);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(26,39,68,0.05);
  }
  .findings-list li:nth-child(2n) { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
  .findings-list li:nth-child(3n) { border-left-color: var(--accent3); }
  .findings-list li strong { color: var(--primary); }

  .nav-pills {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .nav-pill {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .nav-pill:hover { background: var(--primary); color: white; }

  @media print {
    body { background: white; }
    .chart-card { page-break-inside: avoid; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="header-eyebrow">Policy Research &amp; Analytics</div>
  <h1>Global Cost of Living Crisis Index 2026</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">A comparative analysis of economic stress, affordability gaps, and inflation pressures across 80 major cities worldwide — benchmarked against New York (index = 100).</p>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <span>📅 Data Year: 2026</span>
    <span>🏙️ 80 Cities Analyzed</span>
    <span>🌍 16 Regions</span>
    <span>📊 All indices relative to New York = 100</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- NAV -->
  <div class="nav-pills">
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#executive">Executive Overview</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#regional">Regional Comparison</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#affordability">Affordability &amp; Rent Burden</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#tiers">Crisis Tier Profiling</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#inflation">Inflation &amp; Oil Exposure</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#findings">Key Findings</a>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW              -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="executive">
    <div class="section-title">1. Executive Overview</div>
    <p class="section-desc">Headline statistics across all 80 cities. Benchmarked to New York, USA (index = 100).</p>

    <p class="section-intro">
      The 2026 Global Cost of Living Crisis Index reveals a world of extreme economic divergence. A narrow band of wealthy cities — anchored by Swiss financial centers — remains at the top of the cost ladder with robust purchasing power, while a growing cohort of 14 cities is trapped in acute crisis conditions marked by hyperinflation, wage suppression, and severe affordability constraints. The median city globally sits at index 65.5, well below New York, but income levels in lower-ranked cities have not kept pace with cost pressures.
    </p>

    <!-- KPI CARDS -->
    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Median Cost of Living Index</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">65.5</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Half of all 80 cities sit below 65.5 vs. New York's 100 benchmark</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Avg Rent-to-Salary Ratio</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">61.5%</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Mean share of monthly net income consumed by 1BR city-center rent</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Purchasing Power Gap</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">148.7 pts</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Basel (183.7) vs. Beirut (35.0) — the global PPP chasm</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">High-Crisis Cities (Tier 5)</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">14</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Cities classified in the most severe crisis tier — 17.5% of the dataset</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Avg Annual Inflation Rate</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">8.3%</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Mean across 80 cities; skewed upward by hyperinflation outliers (Buenos Aires: 150%)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chart-grid-2" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="chart-card">
        <div class="chart-title">Cost of Living Index Distribution</div>
        <div class="chart-subtitle">All 80 cities ranked by cost_of_living_index (New York = 100)</div>
        <div class="chart-container" style="height:300px;">
          <canvas id="colDistChart"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-card">
        <div class="chart-title">Crisis Tier Distribution</div>
